0,480,540,600,660,720,780,840,900,960,1020,1080,1140,1200,1260,1320,1380]},"sourceCategory":"FieldEvent","serverTimezones":{"kr":{"id":"kr","ianaZone":"Asia\u002FSeoul","utcOffsetHours":9},"tw":{"id":"tw","ianaZone":"Asia\u002FTaipei","utcOffsetHours":8}}},"regionAvailability":{"kr":"1.1","tw":"1.1","global":null},"gameVersion":"1.1","validFrom":"2026-09-08T12:34:06.135Z","validTo":null}],"page":{"total":24,"limit":50,"offset":0,"hasMore":false}},"h":{},"s":200,"st":"OK","u":"https:\u002F\u002Faion2hub.me\u002Fapi\u002Fentities\u002Ftimer","rt":"json"},"07db9178ca8be98d08d165d8e3926b17305438b0538debec6754692a888938d0":{"b":{"items":[{"id":"587ec4cb-765d-476d-bba3-b018f3fdf779","type":"class","slug":"assassin","name":"Assassin","description":"The Assassin is AION 2's stealth-based melee DPS class, built around the dagger. It slips out of sight, closes the gap, and chains rapid blade strikes to delete priority targets before they can react. Skills such as Ambush and Shadowstrike set up surprise openers from concealment, Quick Slice and Flash Slice deliver fast follow-up damage, and Evasion Stance keeps it slippery in a fight. Its strength is high single-target burst at close range, traded against fragility and short reach.","icon":"\u002Fmedia\u002Ficons\u002Faa\u002Faa00748d63b90c548954e3a6626e805c23f90d512eb205a0dbc0c002b6846620.avif","stats":{"role":"melee-dps","faction":"both","weapons":["Dagger"],"playstyle":"A hit-and-run striker: open from stealth with Ambush or Shadowstrike, unload a fast dagger combo of Quick Slice and Flash Slice for back-attack burst, then disengage or weave defensively with Evasion Stance. Being melee-only with a narrow attack arc, it lives and dies by positioning and timing and shines in PvP and on isolated, high-value targets.","ratingPve":4,"ratingPvp":4.5,"difficulty":4,"provisional":true,"stigmaSlots":5},"regionAvailability":{"kr":"1.1","tw":"1.1","global":"1.0"},"gameVersion":"1.0","validFrom":"2026-09-13T08:30:25.169Z","validTo":null},{"id":"8981cebb-7bb0-40d4-9e5e-c0cd31b8bfda","type":"class","slug":"brawler","name":"Brawler","description":"The Brawler is AION 2's ninth class, added in the Chapter 1 \"Land of Sand and Frost\" update, and the first to fight with the new Gauntlet weapon type. NCSOFT describes it as an offensive character who uses its own body to strike its foes — a bare-knuckle melee attacker that closes distance, subdues enemies with augmented skills while \"rampaging,\" and breaks up enemy formations with a wide array of movement skills. Its signature Rampage skill set (Flurry, Roundhouse, Whirlwind, Ground Smash, Ascending Blow, Exploding Fist and Chain Fist) turns momentum into escalating pressure, making it a mobile, combo-driven DPS built around staying on top of its target.","icon":"\u002Fmedia\u002Ficons\u002F16\u002F16bf28ea503a409073b962f43dd6bc8c8aa0b6df65459cffc11e1f16752df723.webp","stats":{"role":"melee-dps","faction":"both","weapons":["Gauntlet"],"playstyle":"A fast, aggressive skirmisher: dash and leap into the fray, chain Gauntlet strikes to build Rampage momentum, then unload augmented finishers while weaving movement skills to reposition and scatter grouped enemies. Rewards players who like high-tempo, in-melee combat with strong gap-closing over ranged safety.","ratingPve":4,"ratingPvp":4,"difficulty":3,"provisional":true,"stigmaSlots":5},"regionAvailability":{"kr":"1.1","tw":"1.1","global":null},"gameVersion":"1.1","validFrom":"2026-09-13T08:30:25.790Z","validTo":null},{"id":"398ef150-16e1-4a50-bbc0-b1a9e28b4b27","type":"class","slug":"chanter","name":"Chanter","description":"The Chanter (\"Guardian Sage\") is one of AION 2's two priest classes, but rather than dedicating itself purely to healing it fights up close with a staff and a battery of empowering mantras. It layers party-wide buffs and back-up healing on top of solid melee pressure, making it the game's signature hybrid support: never the main healer, yet able to keep a group standing while contributing real damage. Its staff doubles as both a casting focus and a close-quarters weapon, letting it weave chants, recovery, and strikes into a single fluid rotation.","icon":"\u002Fmedia\u002Ficons\u002F47\u002F47e5e7c4d57a4b46c6c371e1787e1c0413694c699a1849f7b9791d2148d2b8db.avif","stats":{"role":"support","faction":"both","weapons":["Staff"],"playstyle":"A sustain-and-support bruiser: open with staff combos like Onslaught, Resonance Crush, Impactful Crush, and Crushing Blow to deal physical damage and apply debuffs, while life-leech and stat-boosting mantras keep both it and the party alive through long fights. It thrives in solo play and as a complementary raid pick, trading peak single-target healing for survivability, buffs, and self-sufficient DPS.","ratingPve":4,"ratingPvp":4,"difficulty":3,"provisional":true,"stigmaSlots":5},"regionAvailability":{"kr":"1.1","tw":"1.1","global":"1.0"},"gameVersion":"1.0","validFrom":"2026-09-13T08:30:26.353Z","validTo":null},{"id":"ac065292-e06b-42b5-9c00-b2fc4e68370a","type":"class","slug":"cleric","name":"Cleric","description":"The Cleric is AION 2's dedicated healer, a mace-wielding support class built to keep a whole group alive through extended fights with restorative and protective magic. Beyond mending HP, it is the party's lifeline in group content thanks to its signature ability to revive fallen allies, making it a near-mandatory pick for dungeons and other coordinated encounters. It also has a battle-priest side: offensive abilities such as Earth's Retribution and Judgment Thunder let it chip in meaningful ranged damage and sustain its own mana while healing.","icon":"\u002Fmedia\u002Ficons\u002F20\u002F2074b02137af96d9b01596859765fe8c9ccf8e449791b455d2b835d59117a580.avif","stats":{"role":"healer","faction":"both","weapons":["Mace"],"playstyle":"A back-line healer who cycles AoE and over-time heals plus protective shields to sustain the group, weaving in damage skills like Earth's Retribution (an auto-attack chain that also restores mana) and the wind-element AoE Judgment Thunder between heals. It stays mobile to dodge attacks, since survival often depends on positioning as much as raw healing output.","ratingPve":4.5,"ratingPvp":3.5,"difficulty":3,"provisional":true,"stigmaSlots":5},"regionAvailability":{"kr":"1.1","tw":"1.1","global":"1.0"},"gameVersion":"1.0","validFrom":"2026-09-13T08:30:26.837Z","validTo":null},{"id":"1b5b39f3-0d7b-4e39-a683-e41c3e0b6d8e","type":"class","slug":"gladiator","name":"Gladiator","description":"The Gladiator is AION 2's plate-wearing greatsword fighter, billed by NCSOFT as the \"master of the melee.\" It trades the pure shielding of a guardian for raw offense, swinging a two-handed greatsword to carve through clustered enemies while leaning on heavy life-steal to stay standing. Its role is a Tank\u002FDPS hybrid: a frontline damage dealer whose deep health pool lets it step in as a secondary tank when a party needs one. Signature abilities such as Rending Blow, Blade Dance, Blade Toss, Crushing Wave, and Frenzied Wave center the kit on sweeping area strikes punctuated by ranged blade throws.","icon":"\u002Fmedia\u002Ficons\u002F80\u002F801f1dcaf36717673e1dfcebcc0fe0c9eb242e856855e438d1fe62e9efb36774.avif","stats":{"role":"melee-dps","faction":"both","weapons":["Greatsword","Polearm"],"playstyle":"An aggressive, in-your-face bruiser that closes distance and unleashes wide arcing greatsword swings to hit several foes at once, healing off the damage it deals to outlast opponents. Its AoE burst, gap-closing throw, and defensive tools like Focused Block make it forgiving and strong in both solo PvE and group play.","ratingPve":4,"ratingPvp":3.5,"difficulty":2,"provisional":true,"stigmaSlots":5},"regionAvailability":{"kr":"1.1","tw":"1.1","global":"1.0"},"gameVersion":"1.0","validFrom":"2026-09-13T08:30:27.478Z","validTo":null},{"id":"fbec83dd-d4ed-4883-a286-f2c60a5be7df","type":"class","slug":"ranger","name":"Ranger","description":"The Ranger is AION 2's bow-wielding physical damage dealer, built to punish enemies from afar. Firing precise long-range shots, it keeps a wide read on the battlefield and adapts quickly, opening fights with heavy sniping damage before weaving in faster follow-up volleys. Its signature kit — Snipe, Rapid Fire, Spiral Arrow, Griffon Arrow, and Deadshot — pairs hard-hitting openers with sustained rapid attacks, the hallmark of a ranged DPS that never wants to close the gap.","icon":"\u002Fmedia\u002Ficons\u002F51\u002F513122a26a5e2d7960b945385b014a06088d9688d796d498fcee8d506f8d7c47.avif","stats":{"role":"ranged-dps","faction":"both","weapons":["Bow"],"playstyle":"A mobile, kiting ranged DPS: lead with a high-damage Snipe, maintain pressure with Rapid Fire and arrow skills, and use distance and movement to stay out of melee while chaining shots. Its strong burst and precision from range reward good positioning over standing toe-to-toe.","ratingPve":4,"ratingPvp":3.5,"difficulty":3,"provisional":true,"stigmaSlots":5},"regionAvailability":{"kr":"1.1","tw":"1.1","global":"1.0"},"gameVersion":"1.0","validFrom":"2026-09-13T08:30:28.076Z","validTo":null},{"id":"c09fcc0e-0f10-4fac-a05d-0ba836b2c514","type":"class","slug":"sorcerer","name":"Sorcerer","description":"The Sorcerer is AION 2's ranged magic damage dealer, wielding a Spellbook to command the opposing forces of fire and ice. Fire abilities such as Firebomb, Firestorm, and Blaze set enemies ablaze and stack burning damage, while ice spells like Ice Chain and Cold Snap slow and freeze targets to lock them down. NCSOFT presents the class as an instant-cast specialist that pairs heavy burst with a deep crowd-control toolkit, holding the main-DPS spot in both small and large parties.","icon":"\u002Fmedia\u002Ficons\u002F51\u002F51585560d7c2249c943a42b4bf25b1c2887735a968f8ee852b8892978ab965ee.avif","stats":{"role":"ranged-dps","faction":"both","weapons":["Magicbook"],"playstyle":"A glass-cannon nuker: chain fire spells to apply burn pressure and big single-target or AoE burst, then weave ice skills to slow, root, and freeze enemies so they cannot close or escape. Its largely instant-cast kit rewards aggressive, mobile casting, with builds leaning toward pure-fire damage or ice for added control.","ratingPve":4.5,"ratingPvp":3.5,"difficulty":4,"provisional":true,"stigmaSlots":5},"regionAvailability":{"kr":"1.1","tw":"1.1","global":"1.0"},"gameVersion":"1.0","validFrom":"2026-09-13T08:30:28.634Z","validTo":null},{"id":"729ae454-9879-4a0a-bff6-74831855d9fd","type":"class","slug":"spiritmaster","name":"Spiritmaster","description":"The Spiritmaster (internal id Elementalist) is one of AION 2's eight classes — a ranged DPS who channels the four elements through an Orb. Rather than trading blows up close, it summons fire, water, wind, and earth spirits that act as stationary, turret-like helpers while the caster layers damage-over-time, debuffs, and fear on enemies from a distance. Signature skills such as Cold Shock, Earth Tremor, and Combustion deliver its elemental damage, Siphon drains life for sustain, and Soul's Cry and Ashy Call anchor its crowd control. It is widely regarded as one of the strongest solo classes, with high-impact PvP control, at the cost of a demanding rotation.","icon":"\u002Fmedia\u002Ficons\u002Fe6\u002Fe6e93fcdd934c80428bc0d34b02fdaa12ba232e027601db7058d6cc8a7a9bf06.avif","stats":{"role":"ranged-dps","faction":"both","weapons":["Orb"],"playstyle":"A control-oriented ranged caster: deploy and rotate elemental spirits for sustained pressure, stack elemental DoTs and debuffs, and use fear-based AoE in Soul's Cry and Ashy Call plus Siphon's lifesteal to survive. Its damage falls off sharply without active summons, so it rewards constant spirit upkeep — potent solo and in PvP, but more hands-on in group play.","ratingPve":3.5,"ratingPvp":4,"difficulty":4,"provisional":true,"stigmaSlots":5},"regionAvailability":{"kr":"1.1","tw":"1.1","global":"1.0"},"gameVersion":"1.0","validFrom":"2026-09-13T08:30:29.065Z","validTo":null},{"id":"12613955-ca3b-443e-bc78-82b16a5beaad","type":"class","slug":"templar","name":"Templar","description":"The Templar is AION 2's dedicated tank, a heavily armored frontliner who fights with a longsword and shield. Built to absorb punishment and command attention, it uses taunts like Provoke to pin a boss's aggro to itself while shielding the party behind it. Its kit blends sustained threat from strikes such as Vicious Strike with damage-mitigation tools like Doom Shield and hard-hitting follow-ups in Punishment and Decisive Strike. The result is the anchor of dungeon groups and a durable line-holder in PvP.","icon":"\u002Fmedia\u002Ficons\u002Ffa\u002Ffa59c8326961292902c42a182f5c944fb5258d56c283ec553101ae39e2661ae8.avif","stats":{"role":"tank","faction":"both","weapons":["Sword","Guarder"],"playstyle":"A deliberate, control-focused tank: chain Vicious Strike to build and hold aggro, lock targets with Provoke, then time Doom Shield and damage-reduction abilities to survive boss burst while keeping allies safe. It rewards players who enjoy threat management and well-timed defensive cooldowns over raw output.","ratingPve":4,"ratingPvp":4,"difficulty":2,"provisional":true,"stigmaSlots":5},"regionAvailability":{"kr":"1.1","tw":"1.1","global":"1.0"},"gameVersion":"1.0","validFrom":"2026-09-13T08:30:29.515Z","validTo":null}],"page":{"total":9,"limit":100,"offset":0,"hasMore":false}},"h":{},"s":200,"st":"OK","u":"https:\u002F\u002Faion2hub.me\u002Fapi\u002Fentities\u002Fclass","rt":"json"},"d2d566ec44cb2ad2465c0a05328de5aa5c5d3db639fd753d16c02c8350297668":{"b":{"items":[{"id":"b0849b94-393f-4ef6-a4d7-fb1ea0920829","type":"map","slug":"reshanta-b","name":"Abyss Reshanta B","description":null,"icon":null,"stats":{"mapId":"reshanta-b","width":2048,"height":2048,"worldId":"21","questRuns":[],"gameBounds":{"maxX":102000,"maxY":102000,"minX":-102000,"minY":-102000},"markerSpace":"image-y-down","markerTotal":1265,"markerCounts":{"od":88,"